# Mirrors for pacman inside the sandbox.
#
# mkosi keeps its own repository configuration on the build host, so without
# this file the image has repositories but no servers and `pacman -Sy` fails.
#
# This points at live mirrors while the image itself is pinned to a dated
# archive snapshot, which makes `pacman -S` a partial upgrade. That is
# deliberate and accepted: an agent breaking the OS it was given lands on the
# overlay and dies at the next reset, which is exactly what the disposable
# layer is for. The alternative, pointing at the same archive snapshot as
# mkosi.conf, keeps the sandbox internally consistent but freezes it — nothing
# newer than the golden could ever be installed.
Server = https://geo.mirror.pkgbuild.com/$repo/os/$arch
